<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>German first division summaries on Friday:</p>
<p>Bochum 2 (Gudjonsson 61, Reis 67) 1860 Munich 2 (Winkler 25, Walker 65). Halftime 0-1. Attendance 25,442</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen 0 VfB Stuttgart 0. 21,000.</p>
